1
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:25,730
The lights went out, but your warmth remains,

2
00:00:25,730 --> 00:00:30,340
Echoes drift through electric rain.

3
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:34,390
I trace your smile on the glassy street,

4
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:39,160
Where every step and shadow meet.

5
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:43,670
Soft static hums your name tonight,

6
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:48,690
In every flicker, I feel you light.

7
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:53,080
The world slows down, the colors fade,

8
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:59,910
But your glow inside won’t slip away.

9
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:04,760
Even if the neon dies,

10
00:01:05,810 --> 00:01:09,640
You still burn behind my eyes.

11
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:14,910
Fading city, sleepless soul,

12
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:19,620
You’re my quiet afterglow.

13
00:01:42,190 --> 00:01:47,180
A breath, a spark, a memory hum,

14
00:01:47,180 --> 00:01:51,940
Our song replays though the crowd’s all gone.

15
00:01:51,940 --> 00:01:56,020
The sky turns grey, but my heart still knows,

16
00:01:56,020 --> 00:02:01,590
Your rhythm lingers where the night wind blows.

17
00:02:01,590 --> 00:02:05,280
Your shadow dances through the rain,

18
00:02:06,810 --> 00:02:10,460
In dreams, you call my name again.

19
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:15,220
Between the silence, I still find,

20
00:02:15,220 --> 00:02:20,810
That trace of you you left behind.

21
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:26,200
Even if the neon dies,

22
00:02:27,510 --> 00:02:31,150
You still burn behind my eyes.

23
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:36,560
Fading city, sleepless soul,

24
00:02:37,090 --> 00:02:41,540
You’re my quiet afterglow.

25
00:02:43,690 --> 00:02:47,870
Let the lights dissolve in time,

26
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:53,390
I’ll keep your pulse inside of mine.

27
00:02:53,390 --> 00:02:57,480
Every color, every tone,

28
00:02:57,480 --> 00:03:07,670
Turns to gold when I’m alone.

29
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:23,370
Even when the night grows cold,

30
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:28,160
You’re the fire I still hold.

31
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:34,160
Let the city fade below —

32
00:03:34,350 --> 00:03:38,950
I’m shining in your afterglow.

